@startuml
' Title
title Heijunka System Bounded Contexts

' Bounded Contexts as components
package "Heijunka System" {
    [Scheduling Context] as Scheduling
    [Operator Context] as Operator
    [Notification & Coordination] as Notification
    [Rules & Policy] as Rules
    [Reporting & Analytics] as Analytics
}

' Relationships
Scheduling --> Operator : retrieves skills, availability, ARO status
Scheduling --> Rules : validates fairness, compliance
Scheduling --> Notification : notifies assignments, changes
Scheduling --> Analytics : sends scheduling data
Operator --> Notification : receives assignment notifications
Rules --> Notification : alerts on rule exceptions
Analytics --> Scheduling : provides historical feedback

' Notes
note right of Scheduling
    - Generates & manages schedules
    - Handles rotations & constraints
end note

note right of Operator
    - Manages employee data
    - Tracks skills, memberships, AROs
end note

note right of Notification
    - Notifies teams & operators
    - Coordinates changes (e.g., ARO assignments)
end note

note right of Rules
    - Stores business rules & policies
    - Validates scheduling operations
end note

note right of Analytics
    - Provides reports & metrics
    - Analyzes schedule fairness & utilization
end note

@enduml